###Pure
Class {meta::pure::profiles::doc.doc = 'One daily reading of one panel string of a ridge-top solar array: the survey coordinates and measured quantities straight off the reading relation, plus the tilt, siting and soiling labels and the two indices the mapping derives from those measurements.'} test::solarridge6::domain::ArrayReading
{
  readingDate: StrictDate[1];
  arrayCode: String[1];
  stringCode: String[1];
  tiltClass: String[0..1];
  inverterState: String[0..1];
  sitingLabel: String[0..1];
  tiltBand: String[0..1];
  soilingLabel: String[0..1];
  panelCount: Integer[0..1];
  irradianceWm2: Float[0..1];
  irradianceIndexPct: Float[0..1];
  outputKwh: Float[0..1];
  yieldPerPanelKwh: Float[0..1];
  soilingPct: Float[0..1];
  downtimeMinutes: Integer[0..1];
  noteLength: Integer[0..1];
}
